Changelog
=========

Changes are grouped by commit date; common does not currently have
versioned releases.


common - 2026-11
----------------

* Add CMocka unit tests for common modules and coverage reporting across
  CI providers
* Document public APIs, structures, and unit tests
* Harden directory traversal and recursive directory creation
* Avoid closing cipher handles when unsupported modes fail to open
* Document runner-dependent coverage differences


common - 2026-10
----------------

* Add source-aligned CMocka tests for configuration, CLI, directories,
  ECC, errors, memory, lists, maps, TLV, crypto, and version helpers


common - 2024-11
----------------

* Add allocate-or-die memory helpers, formatted string duplication, and
  libgcrypt alternatives
* Simplify directory-tree scanning
* Normalize LIST, MAP, and TLV types and structure suffixes


common - 2023-12
----------------

* Add list operations and map/TLV iteration helpers
* Remove nested functions for portability


common - 2023-05 to 2023-07
---------------------------

* Improve configuration-file list parsing, default values, and help
  output
* Consolidate Makefiles and improve clang portability


common - 2022-11 to 2022-12
---------------------------

* Add the MAP implementation and support replacing values for existing
  keys
* Improve command-line parsing for optional booleans, extra arguments,
  and list values


common - 2022-02 to 2022-09
---------------------------

* Import the shared common code and add filesystem, list, and TLV tests
* Add directory-tree helpers, configurable entry-type filters, and
  decimal configuration values
* Improve allocation-failure handling and update tests
